  "description": "A comfortable, convention-first object mapper for .NET — compile-time and zero-ceremony. Properties that match by name map on their own; attributes cover the unusual cases. A Roslyn source generator plus C# interceptors emit the mapping code at build time, so there is no runtime reflection, no mapper instance to register, and no startup call. Trimming- and Native AOT-safe, and an easy migration from AutoMapper. MIT licensed.",
